This is the moment of this story where it stops being tragical and starts being magical in a way. It's because this is inspiring to me. So to recap, the country already has doubts about the spoil system. President Garfield's life hangs in the balance and his potential successor is hiding out in New York away from public view. when he receives the letter that starts to change his life. This is in August of 1881. Arthur receives this first letter from Julia Sand, and she is very much not the kind of person
