00:33:36.000 --> 00:33:52.000
just as Sand advised him to. I like to think of Chester Arthur's life that he has a devil on his shoulder and an angel on his shoulder, and Roscoe Conkling is the devil on his shoulder, and Julia Sand will become the angel on his shoulder. His actions as president do bear out not always the exact thing she wants him to do,
正如桑建议他的那样。我总喜欢把切斯特·亚瑟的人生想象成这样：他的肩膀一边坐着恶魔，另一边坐着天使，罗斯科·康克林就是他肩膀上的恶魔，而朱莉娅·桑则成了他肩膀上的天使。他作为总统的所作所为确实证明了——虽然并不总是完全按照她想要他做的那样去做，

